{"ASK_NEED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Everything! what don't I need? food, water, bandages, batteries, sleep, a miracle","Antibiotics, honestly, my little girl has a cough, and it won't go away, and I'm so scared","Some good news, that's what I need, just one good piece of news, I'd trade my last can for it","A hug, I'm not kidding, I'd kill for a hug","Batteries... flashlight batteries -- double-A, anything, I'd pay in cans","Medicine for my husband, he's diabetic, insulin, and we're out, and I'm not saying what I'll do if we can't find any","Just, I don't know, a friend, someone who isn't afraid of me, someone who stays!","Need? Oh God, everything, food, water, a bandage for my foot, new socks, my mother","Honestly? Someone to tell me it's going to be okay, but I'll settle for canned beans","Batteries, we always need batteries, and sleep, and hope","Warm blankets, clean water, and a hug, don't laugh"}},
{"ASK_NEED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|world=rain",{"Water! clean water, we've been boiling the rain, and it tastes like pennies"}},
{"ASK_NEED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Salt, matches, thread, needles, the little things you don't think about","Bandages, clean ones, and alcohol, if you have it, and I'll never say no to canned peaches","News, mostly, and if you've got a deck of cards, I'd be your best friend","Ammo, if you've got it, but I won't ask for more than I can pay for...","Everything, same as you, but I'd start with food and bullets","Medicine, mostly, we're running low","Salt, believe it or not, we're all out and it's killing us"}},
{"ASK_NEED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|hour=20,5",{"A good night's sleep, a full belly, a warm blanket, I don't ask for much","Just one decent night of sleep and a hot meal, that'd do it"}},
