{"ASK_NEED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|world=rain",{"Water filters... tablets, anything that makes the rain drinkable.."}},
{"ASK_NEED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Just good company, honestly, and you're doing fine on that count","Nothing right now. You don't have to give me something just because we're talking"}},
