{"ASK_NEED","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"Antibiotics, always antibiotics, that and sterile gauze... and a few more hours in the day","Sleep, honestly, but if I list supplies: gloves, bleach, clean water, alcohol, needles","I need more of me, and there isn't any more"}},
{"ASK_NEED","role=rescue_medical|st=careful",{"What I need, I won't tell you, you'd steal it"}},
{"ASK_NEED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good,best",{"Honestly? Just you, safe and sound, that's what I need most","Medicine, any kind, and a night of sleep, but I'll manage","Warm socks, mostly, and blankets if you got any","A good strong back to move things, if you've got one to spare","Clean water, always clean water, and I'd never refuse a smile","Nothing you haven't already given, you've been so kind","News from the south, and a bit of luck, and a bottle of whiskey, but mostly luck!","Batteries, dry ones, any size, I'd trade my left boot","Canned goods, always canned goods, and maybe a book or two","A friend, someone who stays, someone like you","Antibiotics, and don't ask why, I'll tell you later","I'd like a second pair of eyes on the night watch, a trustworthy pair","Salt, flour, sugar, and a pinch of hope","Hmm, a hug, honestly, I haven't had one in days","String, wire, nails, rope, anything we can use","Bandages, clean ones, and a bottle of alcohol","A hot meal, not for me, for the little ones","I could use a laugh, got a joke?","Medicine for my husband's heart, if you ever come across any","Seeds, a few seeds, and a patch of dirt","Low on everything, but we're getting by, thanks","A match, a candle, a spark, a little light","You're so thoughtful to ask, we need a hundred things, but a kind word is first","Someone to watch the baby for an hour while I sleep","A pair of boots in size nine, my feet are bleeding","Just keep being you, that's enough!","Peace, maybe, but I know you can't give that, so, a can of peaches","If you could find a deck of cards, I'd owe you a lifetime"}},
{"ASK_NEED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good,best|world=building",{"Help with the roof, it's leaking, and I can't climb anymore"}},
{"ASK_NEED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good,best|world=road",{"A map -- a good one, with the roads marked"}},
{"ASK_NEED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful,neutral|rep=bad,worst",{"What I need is for you to go AWAY","Nothing from you -- thank you very much","I need less trouble, starting with you","What do you care? You'd take it anyway","A lot of things, none of which you'd provide","I need you to STOP asking!","I need space, and you're crowding me!!","I need a good lock, and a better memory","I need you gone","Nothing you could give","Ask me something else, or better yet, don't","If I told you, you'd steal it","I need privacy, and you're violating it","I'll need an apology, but I won't hold my breath","Medicine for the wounds you caused!","I need a world without you in it","I need nothing from you, ever","I need you to leave, and take your questions with you","Safety, and you aren't it","My needs are not your concern","An honest man, and he's NOT you","Peace and quiet, there, I said it, now go","A new neighbor, one who doesn't stink of trouble","Nothing, nothing, nothing, go","You? Help me? That's rich","I'll sort it out, without you!!","Try helping yourself first","I don't need pity, and I don't need you","A reason to trust you, and I haven't found one"}},
